# Domain layer

This crate must compile without a database or HTTP server.

Do not import or depend on `axum`, `sqlx`, `tokio`, Tauri, or SQLite types.

Keep invariants in constructors (`Title::parse`, date range checks, cycle date containment). Use `reconstitute` only for persistence that already passed those checks.
